sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Farmer as Farmer (Mobile App)
    participant Voice as Voice Intake / API
    participant Engine as Estimation & Matching Engine (OR-Tools)
    actor Buyer as Biomass Buyer / Factory (Web Portal)
    actor Scale as Dharamkanta Weighbridge (Web Terminal)
    participant Sat as Sentinel-2 Satellite Engine
    actor KVK as KVK / DAO Agriculture Officer

    %% 1. Intake & Estimation
    Farmer->>Voice: Speaks "4 killa PR-126, 25 October"
    Voice->>Farmer: Displays Confirmation Card (4 acres, PR-126, Oct 25)
    Farmer->>Voice: Confirms ("हाँ, सही है") -> Auto-fills form
    Farmer->>Engine: Requests Stubble Yield & Value Estimate
    Engine-->>Farmer: Yield: 8.0t recoverable, Income: ₹7,680 - ₹11,520

    %% 2. Matching & Booking
    Farmer->>Engine: Find Matched Bundles (Baler + Truck + Buyer)
    Engine->>Engine: Google OR-Tools CP-SAT Solver matches capacity & route
    Engine-->>Farmer: Displays 3 Bundles (Best Value, Fastest Pickup, Max Revenue)
    Farmer->>Engine: Books Bundle #1
    Engine->>Buyer: Holds Buyer Escrow (₹12,000 held in vault)
    Engine-->>Farmer: Booking Confirmed (Status: ESCROW_FUNDED)

    %% 3. Harvesting & Transport
    Note over Farmer,Buyer: Baler compresses stubble into 8.0t bales.<br/>Truck PB-11-AB-4029 collects and drives to weighbridge.

    %% 4. Dharamkanta Certification & Instant Payout
    Truck->>Scale: Arrives at Dharamkanta scale
    Scale->>Scale: Logs Gross: 14.2t, Tare: 6.2t -> Certified Net: 8.0t
    Scale->>Engine: Submits Ticket TKT-DK-2026-9941 & releases escrow
    Engine->>Farmer: Sends instant notification & releases IMPS payout (₹12,000)
    Engine-->>Farmer: Booking Status -> PAID

    %% 5. Satellite Verification & Subsidy
    Sat->>Sat: Sentinel-2 SWIR repeat scan (14-day post-harvest)
    Sat->>Sat: Calculates dNBR (0.038 < 0.15 threshold -> Verified Clean Harvest)
    Sat->>Engine: Generates No-Burn Certificate (CERT-PSETU-889900)
    Engine->>KVK: Queues Certificate in KVK Compliance Portal
    KVK->>Farmer: Approves ₹1,000/acre State Ex-Situ Management Subsidy (₹4,000)
    Farmer-->>Farmer: Downloads Official Green Diploma & Shares with KVK
